+function (libc's `write`, `_exit`, `abort`) counted at its entry depth.
+
+Why addresses cannot escape this accounting: no register but the stack and frame pointers ever
+holds a stack address. The analysis refuses taking a stack address as a value (`lea` of one, the
+stack or frame pointer copied, stored or used in arithmetic, except the modelled frame setup), so
